# Settings

Read theme and app settings with `getSettings()`. Do not import `default.json` from a page or component. UI and templates do not call `getSettings()`; they use Tailwind token classes.

Token **values** live in `src/settings/default.json`. `getSettings()` merges any overlay onto those defaults. CSS variable **names** and fallbacks live in `src/app/globals.css`. The locale layout injects `toCssVars(settings.theme)` on `<html>`.

Scales: `theme.colors` (primary, background, foreground, border, panel, accent 1–4, success, warning, error). Action colors are `{ base, foreground, hover, glow, shadow }` (`glow` lighter, `shadow` darker). Panel is `{ base, foreground, hover }`. `theme.radius` (`sm`–`full`), `theme.borderWidth` (`sm`–`lg`), `theme.container` (`xs`–`xl` plus `full`, as `max-w-container-*`). `header.navFrom` is a named breakpoint (`xs`–`xl`) for when SiteHeader shows desktop nav; breakpoint **widths** stay in `globals.css` and must match `theme.container` pixels (`xs` 480, `sm` 720, `md` 980, `lg` 1200, `xl` 1440). There is no `2xl`. Do not scatter hex in UI or templates. Do not add unused settings keys. Locale list and routing stay in `src/i18n/config.ts` — not here.

Storage swap is `loadSettingsFromJson` in `get-settings.ts`. Follow [docs/content.md](docs/content.md). New or changed tokens must also appear in `src/app/dev/ui` in the same turn. If this summary changes, update `CLAUDE.md` Layout in the same turn.
